          "tool_use_id": "toolu_01QKcKpLG9cyvtkgY3SdwZF9",
          "tool_name": "write_file",
          "input_json": "{\u0022path\u0022: \u0022index.md\u0022, \u0022content\u0022: \u0022# Wiki Index\\n\\n- [[credential-scoping]] \u2014 How the Ingest agent\u0027s Anthropic API key is scoped to its own child-process environment.\\n- [[runtime-paths]] \u2014 How Grimoire resolves runtime file locations from a single composition point.\\n- [[single-composition-point]] \u2014 How centralized resolution of runtime concerns is paired with strict scoping to prevent leakage.\\n- [[write-journal]] \u2014 How the guarded write path journals prior file state for rollback on failure.\\n\u0022}"
        },
